sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Protect as protect middleware
    participant Router as messageRoutes.js
    participant DB as MongoDB Message

    Client->>Protect: GET /api/messages/:groupId Bearer token
    Protect->>Router: next() req.user set
    Router->>DB: Message.find group equals groupId, populate sender, sort createdAt
    DB-->>Router: messages array
    Router-->>Client: 200 messages array

    Note over Router,Client: catch returns 400 with error.Message, a bug, should be error.message
